docs {
  Same mechanism, different entity type.

  Worth showing because this policy is embedded inside the account portfolio
  response. Purging the policy invalidates that whole response, even though
  the client asked for an account.

  That is the main granularity trade-off: the cache unit is a complete
  GraphQL response, not an individual field.
}
